(The ledger's time leaves, batch B - docs/ledger/time.md rows TIM-32,
 TIM-42, TIM-43, TIM-44, TIM-45, TIM-46, TIM-47, TIM-51, TIM-54, TIM-57.
 Same convention as 410_gen_time_a: each leaf called directly off a
 pinned seed, its emitted source printed in full, golden is the
 generated Vox itself.)

Print "--- TIM-32: elapsed reads while the timer is still running ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf timer elapsed while running' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- TIM-42: formatted clock string, direct three-slot form ---".
'rng seed' of 9.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf formatted clock direct' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- TIM-43: formatted clock string, named-parts staged form ---".
'rng seed' of 9.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf formatted clock staged' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- TIM-44: current time's UTC agreement with unix ---".
'rng seed' of 4.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf current time utc agreement' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- TIM-45: duration/elapsed uncast agrees with the seconds cast ---".
'rng seed' of 6.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf timer uncast agreement' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- TIM-46: a timer that was never started ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf timer never started' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- TIM-47: starting an already-run timer restarts it ---".
'rng seed' of 15.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf timer restart resets' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- TIM-51: a negative duration in seconds returns at once ---".
'rng seed' of 21.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf timer negative seconds wait' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- TIM-54: a time renders as its unix seconds ---".
'rng seed' of 8.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf current time renders as unix' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- TIM-57: a time property read from a plain number ---".
'rng seed' of 11.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf time property from number' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaves, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf timer elapsed while running' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.
